\fs24 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 description: 
\fs26 The three elements of Peaceful Warrior form a wearable structure around the head, face and neck. Perforated surfaces shape a helmet, an eye-covering piece and a close-fitting neck guard. The irregular openings allow the body to remain visible beneath the metal, while the rigid material suggests protection and defence. At the same time, the fragmented surfaces recall skeletal structures, giving the otherwise armoured silhouette a sense of fragility and transformation.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
